     <p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年高考绍兴市第一中学考点</span></p><p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疫情防控工作方案</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 18pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为积极应对新冠肺炎疫情，确保考生和考务工作人员的生命安全和身体健康，根据市考试院有关要求，结合我校实际，现制定我校考点</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年高考期间疫情防控工作方案。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、组织领导</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组长：王琛</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副组长：孙洪亮、蒋明、俞奇弘、林萍华</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">组员：刘明玉、冯王亮、何隽豪、沈祥土、陈锋、范国娟、周文龙、全体高三班主任</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、工作要点</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（一）考前准备</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>防疫场所设置。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考点入口（北门和南门）设置测温点和临时隔离点；家贤楼</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼设置备用（发热隔离）试场</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">间，远离其他考场，每间备用（发热隔离）试场设置</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">个考位，并安排合适人选作为备用监考；考点入口和备用（发热隔离）考场间设置专用防疫特殊通道。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>防疫物资准备。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">配备必要的防疫设备设施和物资物品，包括测温设备、手套、口罩（每人每半天</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">只</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的标准）、速干手消毒剂等。配备一定量所需物品，包括一次性防护服或工作服、一次性工作帽、防护面屏或护目镜、防水靴套等。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>环境消杀。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在考前一天对所有考场、考试工作场所的环境卫生进行彻底清洁、整治、消毒、通风等处理。（无刺激性气味的消毒液）对空调通风系统、物体表面进行预防性消毒处理。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>教师和考生健康监测。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考前</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">14</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">天起监测本校考生和教师的健康码状况和检测体温，学生健康码每日由浙江省高校招生考试信息管理系统中导出，教师健康码在每日进校时主动出示给校门口门卫或志愿者。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>全体考生及考务工作人员核酸检测。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日组织全体考生及考务工作人员进行核酸检测，确保应检尽检。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>6.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考前应急演练。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日组织考试工作人员、考生进行包括入场体温检测、突发异常情况处置在内的全过程模拟演练。调试设备，熟悉检测操作，熟练掌握突发事件应急处置方法和程序。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（二）考中流程</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考生、考试工作人员进入考点。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考生和考试工作人员按规定时间到达考点，在考点入口处进行体温检测，体温检测正常才能进入考点。对体温检测超过</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">37.3</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">℃的人员，需在临时隔离点短暂休息后重新测量。体温仍然偏高的考试工作人员，暂停本日相关考试工作，及时到医院就医。体温仍然偏高的考生，专人负责经特殊通道至发热隔离考场参加考试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考试工作人员集中和进场。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试工作人员进入考点后，先到考试办公室旁的休息室等候，佩戴口罩，然后在规定的时间按次序进入考务办公室，进入时注意距离间隔。完成考前准备工作后，由专人带队，经专用通道进入考场，路途中注意距离间隔。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考生入场。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考生进入考点到先到指定的场所休息。进场前</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分钟，按楼层次序由班主任带至考场所在区域，过程中需排好队伍并注意间隔。学生到达考场后，在考场门口排队依此进入考场，进场过程中避免相互交流并注意保持间距。进场后立即到指定位置就座，无特殊情况不要离开考场。考生在考试过程中是否佩戴口罩自愿，但不能影响身份核验。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考中降温防暑。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在温度适宜的条件下，考点的考务办公室和考场可以保持自然通风，也可以采用电风扇等设备加强通风，电风扇在使用前应进行清洗。室外温度超过</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">35</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">摄氏度，可开空调，使用过程中门窗不要完全闭合。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考生和监考员离场。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试结束后，考生听从广播指令错时离场，离场时注意次序，保持间距。考生全部离场后，监考员携带试卷、答卷和其他考试用品返回考务办公室，离开时注意开门开窗通风。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">．</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>隔离试场管理。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试过程中如需启用隔离试场，监考员需穿防护服，戴护目镜、一次性手套，穿防水靴进行监考。试场内门窗打开，原则上不开空调，可开风扇物理降温。考生在隔离试场参考必须佩戴口罩，人数如多于</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人，相互之间应保持最大距离。考试结束后，考生转移至临时隔离点，由卫健部门负责核酸采样，试卷、答题纸、草稿纸在考场内消毒后（紫外线灯照射</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">30</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分钟以上）封装交考务办公室。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">备用隔离考场在当天考试结束后可按如下方式进行消毒：加强对门把手、桌椅等物体表面的清洁消毒，每科考试后，可用有效氯</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">500mg/L</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的含氯消毒剂进行擦拭（</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">擦拭后30分钟，用清水再擦一遍</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">），或用有效的消毒湿巾擦拭。隔离考场考试的考生如出现新冠肺炎疑似病例或确诊病例，应由专业人员及时做好考场的终末消毒。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（三）考后处置</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>单科考试结束后对使用过的考场进行消杀。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考生和监考员全部离开考场后，防疫人员进入考场进行消杀，消杀结束后关闭门窗，贴好考场封条。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>试卷与答卷回收。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">监考员返回考务办公室后，整理好试卷和答题纸，按规定封存后，交给考务组回收人员，监考员在考务办公室要有序交接考试材料，避免拥挤，保持人员间距。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 等线;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>试卷流转。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对试卷运送车辆、试卷保管场所进行彻底消毒，试卷保密室存放试卷前开窗通风，没有窗户的保密室采用风扇加强机械通风。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考后消杀。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">10</span><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日考试工作结束后，考试工作场所的环境卫生进行彻底清洁、整治、消毒、通风等处理。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、应急预案</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考前</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>14</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>天内，考生健康码异常、体温异常。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提供考前</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">48</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小时内核酸阴性报告，经专用通道到考点内</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人以下隔离考场。无</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">48</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小时内核酸阴性报告的，立即进行抗原检测和核酸检测。考试中发现的，当场考试结束后进行抗原检测和核酸检测。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考生抗原检测结果为阴性的，经专用通道到考点内</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人以下隔离考场。考生抗原检测结果为阳性的，将该考生经专用通道带至</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人隔离考场参加考试，监考人员做好防护，穿隔离服监考，期间考生不出考场。核酸采样试剂由考点学校即时送至疾控中心进行测试，核酸阴性，考生正常出考点；核酸阳性，控制考生，并由防疫部门调查处置。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考前无异常，考生进入考点当天健康码或体温异常。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">须经医疗防治站登记评估，符合参考条件的，经专用通道到隔离考场参加考试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考前无异常，考生在考试过程中出现发热或干咳、乏力、咽痛、腹泻等相关症状。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当场考试结束后进行抗原检测和核酸检测。抗原检测和核酸检测参照第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点执行。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.38in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">正常开考后，如卫健部门研判、通报考生或考试工作人员情况异常，经卫健和教育部门、考试机构共同研判后的几种情形：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>情形一：如考生在考试期间被确定为密接、次密接或健康码非绿色，可在原考场继续完成当科考试的。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当科考试结束后，在卫健、疾控部门指导下，对考生答卷等考试材料进行必要的防疫处理后封装。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当科考试结束后，在卫健、疾控部门指导下，对有关考场、通道、桌椅等重点区域和物品进行必要的消杀。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经研判，后续考试可安排至考点备用隔离考场进行。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>情形二：如考生在考试期间被确定为初筛阳性，必须转移到同考点备用隔离考场或必须转移到隔离点等考场的。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日（高考）完成考生核酸检测工作，避免此类情形发生。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考务专门人员准确记录开始处置、考生转移出场、转入相应场所等具体时间节点。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在不影响其他考生正常作答的前提下，“点对点”将考生转移至相应场所。在卫健、疾控部门指导下，对考生答卷等考试材料进行必要的防疫处理后封装，在两名工作人员守护下，随考生一并转运。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">监考员做好情况解释说明和考生情绪安抚工作，引导考场内其他考生继续完成考试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考生转移到相应场所后，监考员告知考生继续考试，考试结束时间按有关规定执行。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试结束后，在卫健、疾控部门指导下，对考生答卷等考试材料、有关考场、通道、桌椅等重点区域及物品进行必要的消杀。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>情形三：考场或考点其他考生均须转移到相应场所的。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日（高考）完成考生核酸检测工作，避免此类情形发生。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在情形二的基础上如须转运多名考生或大批量考生，应仔细清点所有相关考生的试卷、答题卡等考试材料，核对无误后再行封装。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考务专门人员做好情况解释说明和考生情绪安抚工作，引导考生有序转运、继续考试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>情形四：考试工作人员不能继续承担考试工作的</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">用备用考试工作人员替换该人员及其他有关人员，按卫健、疾控部门要求，妥善做好有关人员的转移安置，替换及转移安置工作不得影响考生作答。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">当科考试结束后，在卫健、疾控部门指导下，对该工作人员可能接触到的试卷袋、安检设备等物品进行必要的消杀。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试工作人员为监考员的，当科考试结束后，对相关考场、通道等区域进行必要的消杀。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.34in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对相关涉及考生进行安全性评估，必要时可在备用隔离考场或隔离点考场等场所安排考生参加后续考试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>5.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>日常健康监测考生。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提供考前</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">48</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小时内核酸阴性证明，由家人陪同点对点至考点学校，经专用通道，到</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人以下隔离考场参加考试。考后按原途径点对点返回，接送人员同时按要求进行日常健康监测。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 233.3%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.40in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>居家健康观察考生。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经卫健部门、疾控机构研判可在原考点学校考试的，须提供考前</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">48</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小时内</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">次核酸阴性证明（间隔</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">24</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">小时），由属地防控办协调绿色通行，由家人陪同点对点至考点学校，经专门通道，到指定</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人隔离考场参加考试。考后按原途径点对点返回，接送人员同时进行居家健康观察。其他实行疫情管控的区域、中风险区域考生，以及低风险地区健康码为红码考生可参照执行。需在隔离酒店房间参加考试的，按第</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点执行。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>7.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>集中隔离医学观察考生。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在隔离酒店房间参加考试。由属地乡镇（街道）负责隔离酒店选址工作，属地教育和卫健部门共同落实考试任务。教育考试部门承担考试组织工作，卫健部门指导属地落实隔离酒店防疫工作。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 8.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>确诊病例、无症状感染者考生。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">须经卫健部门、疾控机构和医疗机构等逐一进行专业评估，综合研判是否可以在救治场所安排其参加考试。教育行政部门、招生考试机构依据评估建议，综合研判其是否可以正常参加考试。能参加考试的，考场设在救治场所。</span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>9.</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学校因疫情被划入静态管理。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">根据市考试院、卫健防疫部门要求进行处置，考点通过官网、官微、电话、短信等多种形式将相关信息及时告知学生及家长。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考试期间发生涉疫情况的，监考员或考试工作人员应将相关情况报告考点主考、防疫副主考，并开展相应处置工作；主考第一时间报告当地招生考试机构。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.194in;">在保证考生和考试工作人员生命安全和身体健康的前提下，严格依规做好各项安全保密工作，确保考试正常组织实施、确保考生应考尽考。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">须转运考生的，要指定专人负责维护工作秩序并监督考生有序转运，严肃考试纪律，禁止考生相互交流、交头接耳、传递答题信息。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.194in;">指定专人负责妥善保管考生手机等个人物品，转运期间考生不得使用手机。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按照卫健、疾控部门要求，对转运考生的试卷、答题卡、草稿纸、文具等考试材料和物品进行必要的消杀处理后封装，随同考生一并转运。转运过程中，须有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人以上共同看管转运试卷袋，考生抵达指定场所继续考试前，任何人不得擅自开启或拆封试卷袋。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.194in;">及时向有关考生、家长（或监护人）通报情况，做好解释说明和情绪安抚。必要时，联合卫健、疾控部门主动发声，加强舆论引导，消除考生和家长顾虑，稳妥做好后续考试。同时做好舆情管控。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">如须对考生进行就地临时封闭管控，为相关考生提供必要的生活保障，妥善做好后续考试服务工作。</span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><span style="margin: 0 0 0 0.29in;padding: 0 0 0 0;"></span></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市第一中学</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span></p>
    
